Chief!

573
00:29:02,240 --> 00:29:03,440
It was those two

574
00:29:03,440 --> 00:29:04,350
who made me do it!

575
00:29:04,350 --> 00:29:05,440
Here we go again.

576
00:29:05,720 --> 00:29:06,830
We won't call the police, Ms. Haigou.

577
00:29:06,830 --> 00:29:08,230
We won't call the police.

578
00:29:35,920 --> 00:29:36,980
-Get out!
-Get out!

579
00:29:44,790 --> 00:29:46,480
-Cheers!
-Cheers!

580
00:29:46,830 --> 00:29:49,240
To Ximei's cleared name.

581
00:29:49,400 --> 00:29:50,790
Setting things right.

582
00:29:50,990 --> 00:29:52,430
Successfully cleared.

583
00:29:52,460 --> 00:29:55,260
You're still my cutest sister.

584
00:29:56,860 --> 00:29:58,270
It was a moment

585
00:29:58,480 --> 00:30:00,270
of poor judgment.

586
00:30:01,000 --> 00:30:01,750
I'm sorry.

587
00:30:01,750 --> 00:30:02,480
Don't say that.

588
00:30:02,480 --> 00:30:04,160
You were wronged.

589
00:30:04,160 --> 00:30:04,790
What does it have to do with you?

590
00:30:04,790 --> 00:30:06,050
You were just tricked.

591
00:30:06,270 --> 00:30:07,000
You were used.

592
00:30:07,000 --> 00:30:07,480
You...

593
00:30:07,500 --> 00:30:09,390
I'll buy you a big,

594
00:30:09,680 --> 00:30:11,140
big gold ring later, okay?

595
00:30:11,270 --> 00:30:12,000
It's a deal.

596
00:30:12,000 --> 00:30:12,750
A huge one.

597
00:30:13,960 --> 00:30:15,720
And because of Ximei's incident,

598
00:30:15,720 --> 00:30:17,030
we completely drove Gao Jiaoqi

599
00:30:17,030 --> 00:30:18,880
and Fei out of the village,

600
00:30:19,310 --> 00:30:21,550
and made the villagers trust us more.

601
00:30:21,920 --> 00:30:23,920
It's a blessing in disguise.

602
00:30:24,310 --> 00:30:26,270
But you should take it as a warning.

603
00:30:26,680 --> 00:30:27,960
You used it right this time.

604
00:30:27,960 --> 00:30:28,590
And...

605
00:30:29,440 --> 00:30:30,240
This is called

606
00:30:31,070 --> 00:30:33,200
"every cloud has a silver lining."

607
00:30:34,640 --> 00:30:38,000
As long as Ms. Lin
can take it as a warning

608
00:30:38,510 --> 00:30:41,400
and improve herself,
she's still a good comrade.

609
00:30:41,590 --> 00:30:42,110
Good.

610
00:30:42,310 --> 00:30:45,000
I promise Future Village Chief Chen

611
00:30:45,590 --> 00:30:47,890
that I'll try not to cause trouble
for the leaders.

612
00:30:47,890 --> 00:30:51,150
Saying this makes me feel like
my joy will turn to sorrow...

613
00:30:52,310 --> 00:30:53,270
Cheers! Come on!

614
00:30:53,270 --> 00:30:54,200
Cheers, cheers, cheers!

615
00:30:54,200 --> 00:30:55,030
Let's drink.

616
00:30:55,880 --> 00:30:57,550
I won't use a cup then.

617
00:30:57,550 --> 00:30:59,350
I'll just down one for everyone.

618
00:30:59,640 --> 00:31:00,160
Slow down.

619
00:31:00,160 --> 00:31:00,760
Slow down.

620
00:31:01,340 --> 00:31:02,010
Bottoms up!

621
00:31:07,310 --> 00:31:08,570
Do you raise chickens?

622
00:31:08,640 --> 00:31:09,240
-No.
-No.

623
00:31:09,440 --> 00:31:10,840
Then why is there a sound?

624
00:31:11,960 --> 00:31:12,690
Don't speak.

625
00:31:13,270 --> 00:31:14,070
Someone's here.

626
00:31:14,070 --> 00:31:14,880
Go take a look.

627
00:31:15,120 --> 00:31:16,350
I don't dare go by myself.

628
00:31:16,350 --> 00:31:17,280
I'll go with you.

629
00:31:17,480 --> 00:31:17,940
No need.

630
00:31:19,270 --> 00:31:19,730
I'll go.

631
00:31:21,850 --> 00:31:22,530
Who is it?

632
00:31:29,200 --> 00:31:30,060
Sorry.

633
00:31:30,870 --> 00:31:32,730
I know you're having a gathering.

634
00:31:33,070 --> 00:31:33,640
I don't mean to intrude.

635
00:31:33,640 --> 00:31:35,240
I-I just want to add a dish.

636
00:31:39,070 --> 00:31:40,400
I don't mean to intrude.

637
00:31:46,800 --> 00:31:47,280
Sorry.

638
00:32:00,550 --> 00:32:02,480
Can you hear him?

639
00:32:03,270 --> 00:32:04,710
Not very clearly.

640
00:32:04,730 --> 00:32:05,690
He spoke?

641
00:32:05,710 --> 00:32:06,790
I can't hear clearly.

642
00:32:06,790 --> 00:32:08,120
Then I'll speak louder.

643
00:32:08,790 --> 00:32:09,720
I'm Chen Junnan!

644
00:32:09,720 --> 00:32:10,400
No, no, no.

645
00:32:10,480 --> 00:32:11,820
Don't yell at my door.

646
00:32:15,110 --> 00:32:16,270
It's not about the volume.

647
00:32:16,270 --> 00:32:17,270
He's too far away.

648
00:32:17,270 --> 00:32:20,000
Do we have to move
our chairs over there to listen?

649
00:32:22,350 --> 00:32:23,190
Come in.

650
00:32:31,540 --> 00:32:32,600
Here, give it to me.

651
00:32:38,240 --> 00:32:39,370
Sorry to bother you.

652
00:32:41,070 --> 00:32:41,830
I...

653
00:32:44,680 --> 00:32:45,160
Sit.

654
00:32:45,550 --> 00:32:46,150
Thank you.

655
00:32:49,350 --> 00:32:50,160
Well, I...

656
00:32:53,300 --> 00:32:54,950
I did do a lot of

657
00:32:56,830 --> 00:32:57,640
bad things.

658
00:32:59,720 --> 00:33:01,580
I was also deceived by bad people.

659
00:33:04,070 --> 00:33:06,640
Actually, deep down, I'm still

660
00:33:08,400 --> 00:33:09,310
a kind,

661
00:33:10,180 --> 00:33:11,940
sunny, cheerful boy.

662
00:33:15,470 --> 00:33:17,440
I also grew up in the village.

663
00:33:21,000 --> 00:33:22,930
I want the best for the village too.

664
00:33:23,400 --> 00:33:23,920
Really.

665
00:33:25,720 --> 00:33:26,310
Well...

666
00:33:30,080 --> 00:33:30,880
I'm sorry.

667
00:33:34,550 --> 00:33:35,480
Mr. Zhou,

668
00:33:36,510 --> 00:33:39,680
do you think he's acting?

669
00:33:39,830 --> 00:33:42,640
Based on my years of acting experience,

670
00:33:44,270 --> 00:33:46,130
it doesn't look like he's acting.

671
00:33:47,340 --> 00:33:50,380
My problem can be solved this time,

672
00:33:51,000 --> 00:33:52,400
also thanks to him.

673
00:33:52,400 --> 00:33:53,000
Right?

674
00:33:54,660 --> 00:33:55,720
And think about it.

675
00:33:56,720 --> 00:33:58,680
If a guy is stupid,

676
00:33:59,230 --> 00:34:00,510
how stupid can they be?

677
00:34:02,400 --> 00:34:04,260
All those things he did to harm us—

678
00:34:04,480 --> 00:34:05,810
none of them succeeded.

679
00:34:07,880 --> 00:34:08,280
Look.

680
00:34:09,360 --> 00:34:11,760
He gave us the 7 days, right?

681
00:34:13,020 --> 00:34:14,230
Not only did he spend a lot of money,

682
00:34:14,230 --> 00:34:15,760
but he also almost lost his life,

683
00:34:15,760 --> 00:34:17,670
and now he can't even see his own father.

684
00:34:17,670 --> 00:34:19,510
Sounds pretty miserable, doesn't it?

685
00:34:19,510 --> 00:34:21,550
Well, what if he's out of town?

686
00:34:21,550 --> 00:34:22,590
This guy...

687
00:34:23,489 --> 00:34:26,219
So, Future Village Chief Chen,
what do you think?

688
00:34:27,400 --> 00:34:32,280
I haven't taken office yet.

689
00:34:33,840 --> 00:34:35,210
What do you think, Ms. Zhen?

690
00:34:35,210 --> 00:34:35,940
Sister Zhen.

691
00:34:52,000 --> 00:34:52,730
Understood.

692
00:34:52,880 --> 00:34:55,010
But there's something you don't know.

693
00:34:55,409 --> 00:34:57,640
As the God of Wine in Shapu,

694
00:34:57,930 --> 00:34:59,790
I never use a glass when drinking.

695
00:35:00,000 --> 00:35:01,000
I'll just chug it.

696
00:35:02,070 --> 00:35:03,190
Come on, cheers!

697
00:35:03,280 --> 00:35:04,280
That's my bottle.

698
00:35:04,480 --> 00:35:05,110
Great.

699
00:35:06,930 --> 00:35:08,410
Chug it!

700
00:35:09,620 --> 00:35:10,880
Maybe we should just let him go back.

701
00:35:10,880 --> 00:35:11,670
He's so loud.

702
00:35:11,670 --> 00:35:12,960
My ears are ringing.

703
00:35:12,960 --> 00:35:13,590
So noisy.

704
00:35:21,840 --> 00:35:22,510
Cheers.

705
00:35:22,590 --> 00:35:25,070
-Cheers!
-Cheers!

706
00:35:26,280 --> 00:35:27,280
That's enough.

707
00:35:29,000 --> 00:35:30,710
You have to buy me
a new bottle from the store later.

708
00:35:30,710 --> 00:35:32,070
What a waste of alcohol.

709
00:35:40,230 --> 00:35:41,360
Let me tell you,

710
00:35:41,380 --> 00:35:42,900
with your team

711
00:35:43,190 --> 00:35:47,150
joined by Shapu's richest man,
Chen Junnan,

712
00:35:47,150 --> 00:35:48,920
what is it like?

713
00:35:48,920 --> 00:35:49,670
It's like

714
00:35:50,320 --> 00:35:52,280
strengthening an already powerful force,

715
00:35:52,280 --> 00:35:53,610
like wolves and tigers.

716
00:35:55,580 --> 00:35:57,320
Who let him stay just now?

717
00:36:00,550 --> 00:36:02,710
Treat the store as your own home
from now on.

718
00:36:02,710 --> 00:36:03,880
I'll give you the key now.

719
00:36:03,880 --> 00:36:05,320
You can go anytime.

720
00:36:06,190 --> 00:36:06,920
Is that okay?

721
00:36:07,360 --> 00:36:08,400
Sure, I think it's fine.

722
00:36:08,400 --> 00:36:10,000
Not only that.

723
00:36:10,000 --> 00:36:12,280
I'm a real man.

724
00:36:12,800 --> 00:36:13,760
Didn't I tell you?

725
00:36:13,760 --> 00:36:15,220
I'm Shapu's number one...

726
00:36:15,920 --> 00:36:16,720
Chicken feet?

727
00:36:16,870 --> 00:36:17,790
Courage.

728
00:36:18,070 --> 00:36:19,400
We finished them last time.

729
00:36:19,400 --> 00:36:20,760
Shapu's number one master thief.

730
00:36:20,760 --> 00:36:21,880
I stole something.

731
00:36:21,900 --> 00:36:22,880
What did you steal?

732
00:36:22,880 --> 00:36:24,320
In Gao Jiaoqi's RV,

733
00:36:24,320 --> 00:36:25,840
I went to steal the ring.

734
00:36:28,480 --> 00:36:29,440
That night?

735
00:36:29,510 --> 00:36:30,110
Yes.

736
00:36:31,510 --> 00:36:32,440
Stole the ring?

737
00:36:35,150 --> 00:36:36,320
That's scary in hindsight.

738
00:36:36,320 --> 00:36:37,920
This guy is really stupid.

739
00:36:37,940 --> 00:36:39,070
He only makes things worse.

740
00:36:39,070 --> 00:36:40,710
Why are you saying that?

741
00:36:40,960 --> 00:36:42,760
Good thing you had a backup plan.

742
00:36:42,800 --> 00:36:43,510
Awesome.

743
00:36:43,510 --> 00:36:44,320
Wait, this...

744
00:36:47,320 --> 00:36:48,150
Thank you.

745
00:36:52,860 --> 00:36:53,790
You're welcome.

746
00:36:57,510 --> 00:36:58,920
Let bygones be bygones.

747
00:36:59,510 --> 00:37:00,840
We have to look forward.

748
00:37:01,360 --> 00:37:02,720
Just focus on making the movie.

749
00:37:02,720 --> 00:37:04,450
What's the most important thing
in making a movie?

750
00:37:04,450 --> 00:37:05,170
Excuse me,

751
00:37:05,200 --> 00:37:08,000
what's the most important thing
in making a movie?

752
00:37:08,800 --> 00:37:09,840
Stars.

753
00:37:10,760 --> 00:37:11,730
Can you invite them?

754
00:37:11,730 --> 00:37:12,930
Of course, I can.

755
00:37:13,110 --> 00:37:14,360
You have to invite a star.

756
00:37:14,360 --> 00:37:15,960
Otherwise, what are you going to shoot?

757
00:37:15,960 --> 00:37:17,050
You can't shoot anything.

758
00:37:17,050 --> 00:37:18,810
Junnan, I have one on my wall too.

759
00:37:18,810 --> 00:37:19,870
Can you invite him?

760
00:37:20,210 --> 00:37:20,640
Who?

761
00:37:21,760 --> 00:37:22,590
Stephen Chow.

762
00:37:22,760 --> 00:37:23,840
Chow, right?

763
00:37:25,000 --> 00:37:26,190
I'll make a call and find him.

764
00:37:26,190 --> 00:37:26,880
Alright.

765
00:37:27,030 --> 00:37:28,630
I'll make a call,
and he'll come right over.

766
00:37:28,630 --> 00:37:29,790
-Alright.
-Alright.

767
00:37:29,790 --> 00:37:30,710
It's not a big deal.

768
00:37:30,710 --> 00:37:31,760
No, I...

769
00:37:31,760 --> 00:37:33,110
Wait a minute.

770
00:37:38,070 --> 00:37:39,230
He makes sense.

771
00:37:42,440 --> 00:37:43,230
I know.

772
00:37:44,070 --> 00:37:45,950
If we're shooting "King of Comedy,"

773
00:37:45,950 --> 00:37:47,750
how can we not have Stephen Chow?

774
00:37:49,630 --> 00:37:51,400
We'll just act with him.

775
00:37:54,230 --> 00:37:56,540
Ready to shoot! Cheers!

776
00:37:56,560 --> 00:38:03,930
The opening ceremony officially begins!

777
00:37:57,970 --> 00:38:01,220
[Shapu Village Short Film
"King of Comedy: Vendetta of Vendettas"]

778
00:38:01,220 --> 00:38:04,470
[Good luck with the shoot!]

779
00:38:06,400 --> 00:38:07,670
Dear friends

780
00:38:07,670 --> 00:38:08,760
and guests,

781
00:38:08,960 --> 00:38:11,670
the first movie produced by our village

782
00:38:12,070 --> 00:38:13,930
is going to start shooting today!

783
00:38:15,480 --> 00:38:18,280
-Great!
-Great!

784
00:38:18,550 --> 00:38:19,090
-Great!
-Great!

785
00:38:19,090 --> 00:38:20,380
I'll make it short.

786
00:38:20,800 --> 00:38:21,550
Trust me, everyone.

787
00:38:21,550 --> 00:38:22,320
I will definitely work hard.

788
00:38:22,320 --> 00:38:23,400
Let's do it together!

789
00:38:23,400 --> 00:38:24,330
-Great!
-Great!

790
00:38:26,360 --> 00:38:28,190
And I hope through this movie,

791
00:38:28,190 --> 00:38:30,000
our beautiful scenery

792
00:38:30,060 --> 00:38:31,320
can be seen by more people.

793
00:38:31,320 --> 00:38:32,800
I hope it can make our village popular,

794
00:38:32,800 --> 00:38:35,030
so we can all make big money!

795
00:38:35,110 --> 00:38:36,920
-Great!
-Great!

796
00:38:36,940 --> 00:38:39,050
Three, two, one!

797
00:38:39,110 --> 00:38:41,760
Good luck with the shooting!

798
00:38:45,000 --> 00:38:46,000
Our first step

799
00:38:46,110 --> 00:38:47,400
has been very smooth.

800
00:38:47,400 --> 00:38:48,000
Yes.

801
00:38:48,000 --> 00:38:48,670
The weather is good.

802
00:38:48,670 --> 00:38:49,670
An auspicious day.

803
00:38:49,670 --> 00:38:50,230
Yes.

804
00:38:50,230 --> 00:38:51,150
Today is a really good day.

805
00:38:51,150 --> 00:38:51,690
Today.

806
00:38:52,110 --> 00:38:53,510
-Next, we...
-Very good.

807
00:38:53,510 --> 00:38:54,770
Coordinate the actors

808
00:38:54,800 --> 00:38:55,710
-with the villagers.
-Okay.

809
00:38:55,710 --> 00:38:56,840
When will the set...

810
00:38:58,000 --> 00:38:59,400
Who is on the toilet?

811
00:39:05,760 --> 00:39:06,590
You're back.

812
00:39:06,880 --> 00:39:07,840
Fei!

813
00:39:08,800 --> 00:39:11,000
-Hit him!
-No, no, no!

814
00:39:12,110 --> 00:39:13,670
Come back, come back, come back!

815
00:39:13,670 --> 00:39:14,360
Don't touch him!

816
00:39:14,360 --> 00:39:15,550
Don't try to scam me!

817
00:39:15,550 --> 00:39:17,030
-Don't pull a scam on me!
-Don't pull a scam on me!

818
00:39:17,030 --> 00:39:17,670
Record it! Record it!

819
00:39:17,670 --> 00:39:18,150
Record it all!

820
00:39:18,150 --> 00:39:18,760
Yes, record it!

821
00:39:18,760 --> 00:39:20,070
Don't play this trick; it's dirty!

822
00:39:20,070 --> 00:39:20,880
We've recorded it!

823
00:39:20,880 --> 00:39:21,810
You little punk.

824
00:39:22,120 --> 00:39:23,670
-Keep your distance!
-It's been recorded!

825
00:39:23,670 --> 00:39:26,000
What do you want to say?
Stand right there!

826
00:39:27,880 --> 00:39:28,400
I...

827
00:39:29,230 --> 00:39:32,000
I was beaten by Gao Jiaoqi.

828
00:39:33,230 --> 00:39:34,480
I said I'd come to you.

829
00:39:35,710 --> 00:39:36,920
I have nowhere else to go.

830
00:39:36,920 --> 00:39:37,670
I came to find you.

831
00:39:37,670 --> 00:39:38,190
Back off!

832
00:39:38,190 --> 00:39:39,440
I really like you guys!

833
00:39:39,440 --> 00:39:41,040
My leg, he's grabbing my leg!

834
00:39:42,030 --> 00:39:43,920
Let go! Let go!

835
00:39:44,920 --> 00:39:46,070
Is he even a brother-in-law?

836
00:39:46,070 --> 00:39:47,840
He never treats people like human beings.

837
00:39:47,840 --> 00:39:49,280
He just makes me do dirty and tiring work.

838
00:39:49,280 --> 00:39:50,480
And he doesn't pay me.

839
00:39:50,920 --> 00:39:52,300
And he beat me up like this.

840
00:39:52,300 --> 00:39:53,760
I'll join you.

841
00:39:53,760 --> 00:39:54,630
Let's make a movie together.

842
00:39:54,630 --> 00:39:55,840
And I won't tear down our village.

843
00:39:55,840 --> 00:39:57,240
I'll take revenge on him.

844
00:39:57,880 --> 00:39:58,670
It's a trick.

845
00:39:58,670 --> 00:39:59,110
Don't believe him.

846
00:39:59,110 --> 00:40:00,070
No, you have to believe me.

847
00:40:00,070 --> 00:40:01,670
Let go, let go, let go!

848
00:40:01,840 --> 00:40:02,510
Don't believe him. Don't believe him.

849
00:40:02,510 --> 00:40:03,310
Let go! Let go!

850
00:40:03,360 --> 00:40:04,000
Let go!

851
00:40:04,000 --> 00:40:04,480
Three!

852
00:40:04,480 --> 00:40:06,150
-I came with sincerity!
-Two!
